    - Prevents MCTP collisions between getDateTime() and mctp_ctrl_cmd_get_message_type_support().
    - Ensures BMC can detect MMC reboot/update and resend "get message type support" command to let MMC know BMC MCTP is ready.
    - Restores normal time synchronization flow after MMC reboot or firmware update.
    
