    fby4: sd: Fix INA233_PLDM_SENSOR_THREAD stack overflow (#2564)
    
    Summary:
    # [Issue Description]
    - Related to YV4T1M-2154
    - SD BIC restarts continuously due to INA233_PLDM_SENSOR_THREAD stack overflow
    - Issue occurs specifically with SQ52205 (3rd source) but not with INA233 (main source) or RTQ6056 (2nd source)
    
    # [Root Cause]
    - SQ52205 requires approximately 1068B
    - INA233 or RTQ6056 requires approximately 820B
    - Current INA233_SENSOR_STACK_SIZE of 1024B is insufficient for SQ52205 operations
    
    # [Solution]
    - Increase INA233_SENSOR_STACK_SIZE from 1024 to 1344
    
