    fby4: sd: Get DIMM manufacture information (#2535)
    
    Summary:
    # [Task Description]
    - Related to YV4T1M-1978
    - Implement Meta BMC functionality to extract host DIMM manufacturing date information from the BMC system
    
    # [Motivation]
    - Meta requires the capability to retrieve DIMM manufacturing date data through BMC interface for inventory management and hardware tracking purposes
    
    # [Design]
    - Since DIMM-related threads continuously switch the MUX (multiplexer), the SPD (Serial Presence Detect) information will be accessed during sensor polling after AC power-on and the first POST (Power-On Self-Test) completion
    - Once SPD data is successfully retrieved, the system will not repeatedly fetch the same information during subsequent sensor polling cycles to optimize performance and reduce MUX contention
    - This approach ensures efficient one-time collection of DIMM manufacturing date while minimizing interference with other DIMM operations
    
