    Summary:
    # Description
    - Fix ASIC sensor reading NA after AC-cycle and reboot.
    
    # Motivation
    - If user perform BMC reboot after the AC cycle, ASIC sensors reading would show NA.
      - Root cause: When user perfor AC cycle, BIC would record the AC cycle, so when BMC reboots, BIC would not send the nvme status notification to BMC.
      - Solution: Remove the condition for BIC to determine whether it is after AC cycle. When BMC sends pldm set_event_receiver command, BIC would notify nvme status to BMC.
    
