    Byte 1:3 – MFG ID – 00A015h, LS byte first
    Response:
    Byte 1 – Completion Code
    Byte 2:4 – MFG ID – 00A015h, LS byte first
    Byte 5 – status
    0x00 – idle
    0x01 - busy
    Byte 6 - completion code of last operation
    0x00 – success
    0x80 - unsupported type
    0x81 - initialization failure
    0x82 - out of range
    0x83 - memory allocation failure
    0x84 - write error
