    Summary:
    - Support BMC to read SPD information and write/read PMIC register.
    - IPMI command formate request:
    Byte 0:2 - Byte 1:3 – MFG ID – 00A015h, LS byte first
    Byte 3 - DIMM location
      00h - A0
      01h - A2
      02h - A3
      03h - A4
      04h - A6
      05h - A7
    Byte 4 - Device type
      00h - SPD
      01h - SPD NVM
      02h - PMIC
    Byte 5 - Read data length
    if Byte 4 = 0x01 SPD NVM
      Byte 6:7 - 2 bytes offset, LS byte first
      Byte 8:~ -  Write data
    Otherwise
      Byte 6 - 1 bytes offset
      Byte 7:~ - Write data
    
